# Whitelist policy: track only Agda sources, the library file, and the README,
# at the repo root and inside the layer subdirectories.
*
!*/
!*.agda
!*.agda-lib
!README.md
!.gitignore

# ...but these directories are local-only archives / artefacts, never tracked
# (even though they contain .agda files):
OLD/
unused/
latex/
.claude/
